  1416	
  1417	       The Board shall manage and operate the grounds of the [Kennedy Center] in a manner
  1418	       consistent with National Park Service regulations and agreements in effect on July 21,
  1419	       1994. No change in the management and operation of the grounds may be made without
  1420	       the express approval of Congress and of the Secretary of the Interior.
