   197	
   198	slate, that some new names had been put forward, and that the slate presented reflected the
   199	Committee's decision. Mr. LaFauci added that the Committee is appointed by the Chair not less than
   200	thirty days prior to the annual Board meeting. Representative Beatty indicated that she accepted that
   201	answer.
   202	
   203	Secretary Lutnick stated that although it was not the ordinary process, the Board was open to
   204	nominations from the floor, and invited any member wishing to nominate an alternative candidate to do
   205	so. No nominations were made from the floor.
