   840	
   841	
   842	WHEREAS, the John F. Kennedy Center for the Performing Arts (“Center”) is currently
   843	experiencing decades of physical neglect and deferred maintenance that have resulted in
   844	significant degradation to the structure of the facility;
   845	
   846	WHEREAS, the Center has been in dire need of funding for both the physical plant and the
   847	programming mission, historically losing $100M per year;
   848	
